{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0103_1000_p", "source_sha256": "5618341f816ce128163198a01a9dc866f589c296d2f5aa1f4e8b1823a144a059", "ja": "（あれ、なんだかデスク周りが\n整理されてるような……）", "zh": "（咦？\n总觉得办公桌上的东西被人整理过了……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0103_1001_007ior", "source_sha256": "0b1525552a29eb46c1c21b00806d7b841d505199d6e05b5cfdba82880306aeb3", "ja": "す、すみません、お兄さまっ！\n今すぐ、ここの床もキレイにしますからっ！", "zh": "对、对不起，兄长大人！\n我现在立刻把这里的地板也打扫干净！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0103_1002_p", "source_sha256": "2a2e928df4f55b0c773a4bb609706fe007cdf295889796203fcc8f9e4909fde7", "ja": "い、伊織！？　急にどうしたんだ？\n……というか、こんなところで何してるんだ？", "zh": "伊、伊织！？你怎么突然这样？\n……应该说，你在这种地方做什么？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0103_1003_007ior", "source_sha256": "78534fa842b680464ad861a5248150397ad124d10c3f869d61ea35efeeba299a", "ja": "……見たらわかるでしょ？　お掃除よ。\nほら、わかったらさっさとどいてちょうだい。", "zh": "……看就知道了吧，我在扫地喔。\n好了，要是明白了就快点让开。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0103_1004_007ior", "source_sha256": "85cf2491825f87c71fc5283f3c4563a1a97592487e3fbc840c446da5b84f3c7e", "ja": "あ、散らかってた書類も整理しておいたから、\n感謝しなさいよねっ。", "zh": "啊，我帮你把到处乱放的文件整理好了，\n快点感谢我吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0103_1005_p", "source_sha256": "a467d5ea2d39ee4c82820ce3d8b1c0ad1632e499833605dc91ddf27a4ee416c3", "ja": "あ、ありがとう……。でも、本当にどうしたんだ？\nたしか今は、今度の舞台の役作りで忙しいはず……", "zh": "谢、谢谢你……但你到底怎么了？我记得你现在\n应该忙着揣摩下次舞台剧要扮演的角色……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0103_1006_p", "source_sha256": "89eeab79ef0df893c87b7df1d4b152aa1316333a5096684ba69f5d5cce150b59", "ja": "はっ！　役作り……？", "zh": "啊！你在揣摩角色……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0103_1007_007ior", "source_sha256": "f87cb20824a2fad365439cd251e71fa705ddd84fe16786f70888cc22b8457a2e", "ja": "そう。私、シンデレラ役をやるじゃない？\nだから今、こうして頑張ってるの♪", "zh": "没错，我不是要演灰姑娘吗？\n所以就像你看到的，我正在努力喔♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0103_1008_007ior", "source_sha256": "a550cff9638c2f3272d649478915620f0ecd35822a55e916b7d40321f9cfe14b", "ja": "そうだ！　ちょうどいいから、あんたも協力しなさい。\n誰役でもいいから、やってみてくれる？", "zh": "对了！你正好也在，就协助我吧。\n随便演谁都行，你能陪我对戏看看吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0103_1009_p", "source_sha256": "fd2fb8091512492263600a8b438bbd93a8bd27d8de63a23a4fad7cb437cde60d", "ja": "誰役でもいい、か……。よし、任せてくれ。\nいお……シンデレラ！　ここがまだ汚れていてよ！", "zh": "随便演谁都行吗……好，包在我身上。\n伊……灰姑娘！这里还脏兮兮的喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0103_1010_007ior", "source_sha256": "630d51710245b1ae8a526cfd5708added7da9ad9b46c3b86b92419cd01b90653", "ja": "むっか～！　そんな細かいとこ知らないわよ！\nいいじゃない、ちょっとくらい！", "zh": "真火大～！我才懒得管那种小地方！\n只是有点脏有什么关系！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0103_1011_p", "source_sha256": "a64e62c98da53528528f011f479b67d2c464eeb3aa4b4b3994f5fe6384cd5e38", "ja": "ええっ！？　し、シンデレラ、\n母に向かって何という態度を……！", "zh": "什么！？灰、灰姑娘，\n你跟妈妈说话这是什么态度……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0103_1012_007ior", "source_sha256": "4e0a0dba6d9e904dfb4fc5156c0cce6b10eee8df2125293dab2c1c9cb975e8c4", "ja": "……ダメ。ぜんぜんダメね。あんたが継母役だと、\n私、ちっとも役に入れないみたい。もういいわ。", "zh": "……不行，完全不行呢。\n你演后母我好像完全无法融入角色，还是算了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0103_1013_p", "source_sha256": "8a91f6d5d6dbf365db0ea0d1755b5fd1672bf6b336331abf0e4227112a4f7cbd", "ja": "そ、そうか。なんだか悪かった……\nような、そうでもないような……？", "zh": "这、这样啊，真抱歉……\n但又好像不是很抱歉……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0103_1014_007ior", "source_sha256": "8fcc2a45e7269eedd2bb8b69da3ade9621e95ac53393e3636118babaffcff1bc", "ja": "そうでもなくないの！　もう、どうして継母役を\n選ぶのよ。もっと別の役にすればいいのに……。", "zh": "你就是该觉得抱歉！真是的，你干嘛选后母来演啊，\n明明有其他角色可以选……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0103_1015_p", "source_sha256": "406aa4a2aad0c28624f83d1707f0055f9e016eaf0c6272e5eaff577d20f86548", "ja": "別の役か。たとえば？", "zh": "其他角色吗？举例来说？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0103_1016_007ior", "source_sha256": "69b1c034c89c5f74b7054c87ca818e7e0c302b8e451a015f0d7acde4fc0dfae6", "ja": "だ、だから……。\nほら、あるじゃない。大事な役。", "zh": "就、就是……\n你想一下啊，不是有一个很重要的角色吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0103_1017_007ior", "source_sha256": "6b5f62f9c07a61cf6c109fae00e95f3adb47b7e8bdac9d86a6b39d1ff9564219", "ja": "その……。\nお……。", "zh": "就是那个……\n王……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0103_1018_p", "source_sha256": "bca2568ec041d8b7cb9429ae525b743a81159e8eeb5cff15e07463c541f47320", "ja": "お？", "zh": "王？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0103_1019_007ior", "source_sha256": "0092cbba83d4a9659e74dd384076fba83600852237937fbd94f1db365de7b873", "ja": "……お、大きなカボチャの役～っ！", "zh": "……王、王国里的大南瓜啦～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0103_1020_007ior", "source_sha256": "65570699dc7edc10cd5aa6c5e6e1a23bf7d067222fbfcc574d7a684e25d3038e", "ja": "馬車になって私を運ぶんだから、あんたにピッタリ\nでしょ！？　さあ、さっさと魔法にかかりなさーい！", "zh": "它会变成马车载我去王宫，非你莫属了吧！？\n好了，快去让仙女帮你施法──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0103_1021_p", "source_sha256": "be84e74201fdef7edc3c2c32d11ae66a19761cec60e2959580a8cf54bb8c049b", "ja": "（どことなくヤケ気味に命令されてしまった。\nとりあえず、車のキーでも取りに行くか……）", "zh": "（她命令我的口气好像有点自暴自弃。\n总之，我先去拿车钥匙吧……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
